@@ -0,0 +1,350 @@
+// Created on: 2005-09-08
+// Created by: Alexander GRIGORIEV
+// Copyright (c) 2005-2014 OPEN CASCADE SAS
+//
+// This file is part of Open CASCADE Technology software library.
+//
